# Performance model

**Prerequisites:** [Development and delivery](/docs/concepts/development-and-delivery/).
**Kind:** concept.
**Next:** [Develop and inspect](/docs/how-to/develop-and-inspect/).

| Moment | Work |
| --- | --- |
| Edit | Watch rebuilds the lowered module |
| Compile | Roc toolchain on generated source |
| Document GET | `@view` returns a full document |
| One-shot mutation | `@patch` HTML over SSE; Datastar morphs one tab |
| Command | Empty SSE or a small JSON body — no HTML morph |
| Live poll | `GET /sse`; unchanged HTML is skipped |
| Bundle | Native compile plus resource copy |

Measure the preview Dev **Performance** panel and HTTP timings on the same
origin. Do not optimize for tutorial completion counts. Prefer a smaller
fragment over a document shell on every click. Prefer `@command` when the DOM
should not change.

**Related:** [Runtime](/docs/reference/runtime/).
